+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a deterministic 5,000-record store, measured end to end from process start to
+exit over 300 release-mode hook invocations on 2026-09-14:
+
+| Health-gate read path | SessionStart p50 |
+|---|---:|
+| Before: live `PRAGMA quick_check`, direct FTS row count, and body-length scan | 16.654600 ms |
+| After: recorded `quick_check` result, trigger-maintained `fts_rows`, and the body `CHECK` constraint | 1.039291 ms |
+
+The after path moved `quick_check` off the hook's read path. The `fts_rows`
+counter and `CHECK (length(body) <= 2000)` constraint were added as part of the
+same change, replacing the other size-dependent health queries on that path.
